@group A
@commands SQ-PTH-11 rerun from z 995.5, 994.5 and 996.2: snowball and ender pearl (bot thrower); then `breakStallTicks = 0` (restart) and the 995.5 snowball again
@pass 995.5: snowball and pearl stop in the edge web and break about 3 ticks later where they stopped; the pearl teleports the bot there and is gone; 994.5 and 996.2 as SQ-PTH-11; with 0 the edge-cell snowball hangs (no break)
