## SQ-PS15B-05 | timing on: cows penned in a ripe 7x7 field 60 s, counts= near 0 after the first window; right-click harvest and replant do not raise it; young crops not slowed
@group A
@commands Ripe wheat field with `[debug.passthrough] timing = true`: cows penned in it 60 s; then right-click harvest (and a Create harvester pass) over the field while they stay
@pass after the first window the `counts=` field stays near 0 (baked); harvest and replant do not raise it; the slowdown follows the growth (young crops not slowed)
