## SQ-PS15B-09 | boot 1 on the instance (r1115-model) toml: migration line, new table shape
@group A
@commands Boot once with the r1115 srv toml (RING / CUBE, denseFrom 6, `[surface.passthrough.leaf_pile]`)
@pass log line "pass-through tables moved to the 2026-11-15 model"; toml has SIDES / FACES, denseFrom 3, surroundedAt 6, `[surface.passthrough.layers]`, no leaf_pile; second boot: no line
@fails `PassConfigMigration`
@from batches/r1116/ps15b_a.qb
bootexpect pass-through tables moved to the 2026-11-15 model
shell grep -c 'neighbours = "SIDES"' config/creativecompat-common.toml; grep -c 'neighbours = "FACES"' config/creativecompat-common.toml; grep -c 'neighbours = "RING"\|neighbours = "CUBE"' config/creativecompat-common.toml; grep -c 'denseFrom = 3' config/creativecompat-common.toml; grep -c 'surroundedAt = 6' config/creativecompat-common.toml; grep -c 'passthrough.layers\]' config/creativecompat-common.toml; grep -c 'passthrough.leaf_pile\]' config/creativecompat-common.toml; true
look shell: SIDES >= 1, FACES >= 1, RING/CUBE 0, denseFrom 3 in every table, surroundedAt 6 in every table, layers 1, leaf_pile 0 (second boot: SQ-PS15B-09b)

## SQ-PS15B-10 | layer tier (G7.4): snow 1-7 walk-through 1.0 to 0.4, 8 a snow block; leaf pile to 0.6 at 8; bamboo leaves and full bamboo leaves on one 8-layer scale to 0.6 at 8; sand, ashes, fodder, sawdust never
@group A
@commands Layered blocks with a zombie (speed 0) in each height (setblock with `layers=`): snow 1 to 8, IW oak leaf pile 1 to 8, Twigs bamboo leaves 1 to 4, `creativecompat:bamboo_leaves_full` 5 to 8, IW sand layer, Supplementaries ash and fodder 1 to 8, IE sawdust 1 to 9; zombie y; then a random-tick burst on a lone 8-layer snow
@pass snow modifier none, -0.1, -0.2 ... -0.6 for 1 to 7, the zombie stands at y -60 (inside, no collision), 8 none; leaf pile none at 1, -0.057 ... -0.4 at 8; bamboo (Twigs 1 to 4, then full 5 to 8) as the leaf pile: none at 1, -0.057, -0.114, -0.171, then -0.229, -0.286, -0.343, -0.4 (one rising scale, no step back at 5); sand, ash, fodder, sawdust: none at every height (not walk-through); the 8-layer snow becomes a snow block
@fails `PassRule.layerWalk` (H = max for leaf layers, max - 1 for snow), tags `creativecompat:passthrough_layers` / `_open` (passthrough_tags.js), `SnowLayers.collision` / `SnowLayerPassMixin`
@reviewed 2026-11-17
