## SQ-PS15B-11 | snow layers on top vs through: leather boots stand on 5 layers (snow surface speed), sneak sinks; bare feet walk through (no BlockRunner modifier); sand layer only BlockRunner dust
@group A
@commands Bot P on snow layers 5 (x 1100 to 1104): bare feet attribute dump and y; leather boots: y and dump, then sneak 2 s: y; placing an 8th layer by hand on a 7-layer pile; sand layers 3 to 5: dump
@pass bare feet: y -60, only the pass-through modifier (a1386f64-...) at -0.4, no BlockRunner modifier; leather boots: y -59.375 (5 of 8 layers), only BlockRunner's snow modifier (0.75), no pass-through modifier; sneaking in boots: y -60 and the pass-through modifier back; the 8th layer placed by hand gives a snow block; sand 3 to 5: only BlockRunner (dust 0.85), no pass-through modifier
@fails `SnowLayers.collision` (standsOn, isAbove, isDescending), `SnowLayerPassMixin` getStateForPlacement, blocktags.js `runner.snow` with `b.snow`
@reviewed 2026-11-17
