## SQ-PS15B-13 | layers fall and stack: snow 3 onto 2 -> 5, snow 3 onto 7 -> snow block + 2 above, salt 2 onto 7 -> 8 + 1, bamboo 3 onto 3 -> full 6, sawdust onto air -> lands, snow into water -> snowballs
@group A
@commands Each pile sits on a stone block 4 above the ground (or over a water pool); the stone is removed and the pile falls onto the ground pile below
@pass the merged states as in the title (one `say` line each); the water case leaves 3 snowballs as an item entity and no snow
@fails `FallingLayers.holdAndQueue` (updateShape mixins: SnowLayerFallMixin, TwigsBambooLeavesMixin, IeSawdustFallMixin), `FallingLayerEntity.tick` landing, `FallingLayers.land` merge / `withLayers` / `SnowLayers.fullToBlock`, `drop`
