@@title SQ-PS15B-26, -27 / CQ-PS15B-04 Own config watcher (Creative Common), 2026-11-17 ([plan_post_scratch_1115.md](../plan_post_scratch_1115.md) G11; [plan_post_scratch_1115b.md](../plan_post_scratch_1115b.md) E3; TODO `tooling/scratch-1115-follow-ups-2 #10`)
@@date 2026-11-17
